{"text":"〔正光〕□年四月廿一日，南□寺□□□□員仰為父母、師僧、法界眾生，敬造彌勒尊像一區。願此善普津，咸登正覺。","tags":[{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"寺","refId":null,"text":"寺","start":14,"end":15},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"法界","refId":null,"text":"法界","start":28,"end":30},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"眾生","refId":null,"text":"眾生","start":30,"end":32},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"彌勒","refId":null,"text":"彌勒","start":35,"end":37},{"name":"Udef_Buddhist_Term","term":"正覺","refId":null,"text":"正覺","start":50,"end":52}]}